{"id":"adee942fa5cea421","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance.md","title":"量词实例不必是字面子公式","display":"ex-quantifier-subformula-instance — 量词实例不必是字面子公式","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance","aliases":["72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance"],"display":"ex-quantifier-subformula-instance — 量词实例不必是字面子公式","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§2.1.1,2.3.2, print27,32/PDF39,44; local boundary example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-quantifier-subformula-instance — 量词实例不必是字面子公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64d508412cdc602b\" href=\"?note=64d508412cdc602b\" title=\"72-df-analytic-formula-closure\">72-df-analytic-formula-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§2.1.1,2.3.2, print27,32/PDF39,44; local boundary example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in R\">\\(P\\in R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(P)=1\">\\(a_R(P)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>；变量、常元与关系符号按语法约定互异。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P(c)\\notin\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(\\forall xP(x)),\\qquad\nP(c)\\in\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(\\{\\forall xP(x)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P(c)\\notin\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(\\forall xP(x)),\\qquad\nP(c)\\in\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(\\{\\forall xP(x)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该全称式的字面子公式只有自身和 P(x)，而闭常元实例 P(c) 与两者均不同。取子公式 P(x) 后合法代入 c，便进入 An。它说明把命题版子公式定理直接推广到一阶字面语法为何会失败。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-analytic-formula-closure","status":"resolved","id":"64d508412cdc602b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(P)=1","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P(c)\\notin\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(\\forall xP(x)),\\qquad\nP(c)\\in\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(\\{\\forall xP(x)\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":1319,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause-validity]] · [[72-df-first-order-factoring]] · [[72-df-first-order-r-resolution]] · [[72-df-natural-deduction-validity]] · [[72-df-r-resolution-derivation]] · [[72-df-rule-admissibility]] · [[72-ex-first-order-factoring-collapse]] · [[72-ex-quantifier-subformula-instance]] · [[72-lem-first-order-clause-substitution]] · [[72-thm-admissible-rule-extension]] · [[72-thm-first-order-analytic-property]] · [[72-thm-first-order-r-resolution-soundness]] · [[72-thm-natural-deduction-classical-soundness]] · [[72-thm-propositional-compactness]] · [[72-thm-r-resolution-refutation-soundness]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增18项：[[72-df-analytic-formula-closure]] · [[72-df-atom-family-mgu]] · [[72-df-first-order-clause]] · [[72-df-fir